  "label": "Sexual Performance",
  "description": "Sexual performance refers to the ability to engage in sexual activity with desired duration, intensity, or satisfaction. The meme humorously compares the duration of a sexual act to the launch of a rocket, which is a metaphor for performance under pressure. This is a cultural and social concept related to sexual health and humor, which is not visible in the image but is necessary to understand the analogy.",
